### RAG Service - example requests (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Start: docker compose (postgres-rag, reranker, ollama) -> eureka-server -> rag-service
### Through the gateway: {{rag}} = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rag  (direct: http://localhost:8093/api/v1/rag)
### Sample files are in ../samples (all FAKE company documents).

@rag = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rag

### 0. Health - expect "db" UP
GET http://localhost:8093/actuator/health

### ===================== UPLOAD (multipart/form-data) =====================
### Each upload returns 202 with "status": "PROCESSING"; indexing runs in the background.

### 1. Warranty policy (Markdown) - category "warranty"
POST {{rag}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="warranty-policy.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../samples/warranty-policy.md
--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

warranty
--RagBoundary--

> {% client.global.set("warrantyDocId", response.body.id); %}

### 2. Return policy (plain text) - category "policies"
POST {{rag}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="return-policy.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../samples/return-policy.txt
--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

policies
--RagBoundary--

### 3. Shipping FAQ (3-page PDF) - category "shipping"; answers can cite page numbers
POST {{rag}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="shipping-faq.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../samples/shipping-faq.pdf
--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

shipping
--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Shipping FAQ 2026
--RagBoundary--

### 4. Troubleshooting guide (Markdown) - category "support"
POST {{rag}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="troubleshooting-guide.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../samples/troubleshooting-guide.md
--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

support
--RagBoundary--

### 5. Status - wait until all 4 are "READY" (usually a few seconds each)
GET {{rag}}/documents

### 6. One document
GET {{rag}}/documents/{{warrantyDocId}}

### ===================== SEARCH (retrieval only) =====================
### Look at "diagnostics": vectorHits, keywordHits, afterFusion, afterMetadataFilter, reranked.

### 7. Meaning-based: no word "refund" needed - the VECTOR leg finds the return policy
POST {{rag}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "Can I get my money back for headphones I already opened?" }

### 8. Exact code: the KEYWORD leg finds "E-4012" even though it has no semantic meaning
POST {{rag}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "E-4012", "topK": 3 }

### 9. METADATA FILTER: only the "shipping" category - expect chunks from shipping-faq.pdf only
POST {{rag}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "How long does delivery take?", "filters": { "category": "shipping" } }

### 10. Filter by file type
POST {{rag}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "What is covered?", "filters": { "fileType": "md" } }

### ===================== QUERY (retrieval + answer) =====================

### 11. Answer with citations - expect "2-year limited warranty" [1] and "sources"
POST {{rag}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How long is the warranty on laptops and what does CarePlus cost?" }

### 12. PDF page citation - expect $29 and a source with "pageNumber": 2
POST {{rag}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How much does international shipping cost?" }

### 13. Not in the documents - expect "answered": false, NO invented answer
POST {{rag}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the CEO's favourite colour?" }

### ===================== ERRORS =====================

### 14. Same file again - expect 409 "Duplicate document" with "existingDocumentId"
POST {{rag}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="warranty-policy.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../samples/warranty-policy.md
--RagBoundary--

### 15. Unsupported type - expect 400 "Unsupported file type '.exe'"
POST {{rag}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="setup.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

fake binary
--RagBoundary--

### 16. Invalid search - expect 400 with errors for query and topK
POST {{rag}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "", "topK": 50 }

### ===================== DELETE =====================

### 17. Delete the warranty policy - expect 204; its chunks disappear from search
DELETE {{rag}}/documents/{{warrantyDocId}}

### 18. Ask again - expect "answered": false (the document is gone)
POST {{rag}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What does CarePlus cost?" }
